BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Outdoor Bandshell Concert w/ 3 Live Bands (Golden Gate Park)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T190000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638807@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerGolden Gate Park’s 125+ Free
  Outdoor Bandshell Concert Series (2026)Free live music is back in the par
 k.\nIlluminate LIVE returns to the Golden Gate Bandshell in Golden Gate Pa
 rk on Sunday\, March 1\, 2026\, launching its sixth season of free outdoor
  concerts with more than 125 performances scheduled through mid-November.\
 n\nThe long-running series has quietly become one of San Francisco’s big
 gest free music traditions\, drawing more than 250\,000 attendees each yea
 r. Since 2020\, Illuminate LIVE has presented more than 700 free concerts 
 and welcomed nearly 1 million music fans to the historic Bandshell (also k
 nown as the Spreckels Temple of Music).\nAfter the afternoon sets\, the 20
 26 season of Crucial Reggae Sundays launches with resident DJs Irie Dole\,
  Guid8nce and DJ Sep.\n2026 Season – March to Mid- November\nThe 2026 se
 ason features more than 125 free\, all-ages performances\, typically held:
 \n\nWednesdays – Midweek Melodies\nFridays – Friday Happy Hour\nSunday
 s – Crucial Reggae Sundays\nPlus select Saturdays and special cultural e
 vents\n\nOriginally launched during Golden Gate Park’s 150th anniversary
 \, Illuminate LIVE has grown into a cornerstone of the city’s free publi
 c arts scene\, supported by private funding\, grants and partnership with 
 the San Francisco Recreation and Park Department.\n\n2026 Free Bandshell C
 oncert Schedule\nCatch live music in the park every Wednesday\, Friday and
  Sunday (plus select Saturdays) through November. All shows are free and o
 pen...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://illuminate.org/venues/golden-gate-bands
 hell/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-bandshell-concert-w-3
 -live-bands-golden-gate-park/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/screen
 shot_2024-02-26_3.54.16_pm.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Spreckels Temple of Music (Golden Gate Park Bandshell)\, Music Co
 ncourse Dr\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-bandshell-concert-w-3-live-bands-
 golden-gate-park/
END:VEVENT
