BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Próxima Parada – Nico Solo Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1637417@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerNico Larson is a California si
 nger-songwriter and the lead singer\, pianist\, and guitarist of the band 
 Próxima Parada. He writes vulnerable songs centered on personal growth an
 d human connection.\nPróxima Parada means “next stop” in Spanish and 
 Portuguese. While riding the bus in their hometown of San Luis Obispo\, Ca
 lifornia\, Nico and his bandmates would hear at every stop\, “Now approa
 ching\, próxima parada…” After years of touring the U.S. and moving f
 rom one next stop to another\, the band has developed an uplifting\, groov
 e-driven sound that explores embracing who we are while working toward who
  we’re becoming. Their music blends elements of soul\, R&B\, folk\, and 
 indie rock.\n\nFor this solo performance\, Nico will share Próxima Parada
 ’s songs in their original form\, just as he first wrote them: alone at 
 the piano.\nopening set by the Bay Area’s own Zoë Winter.\n\n$30.00\n\n
 Tickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/proxima-parada-ft-zoe-winter-an-inti
 mate-set-at-the-faight-tickets-1997481710567?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: h
 ttps://sf.funcheap.com/prxima-parada-nico-solo-show/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/SF_Oct
 1_FEED_opener.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Faight\, 475 Haight St\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/prxima-parada-nico-solo-show/
END:VEVENT
