 f handmade Middle Eastern desserts!\n\nExperience the rich culture and tra
 ditions of the Middle East with live music\, entertainment\, and performan
 ces throughout the festival. Browse our local vendor booths featuring uniq
 ue crafts\, jewelry\, gifts\, and more.\nThere’s something for everyone 
 to enjoy. Families can visit our Kids Corner for ages 3–12\, featuring a
 rts & crafts\, activities\, and entertainment just for kids. Adults can re
 lax and enjoy our Hookah Lounge\, while guests can also sip on a variety o
 f refreshing craft drinks throughout the festival.\nBring the whole family
  and spend the day with us! Whether you come for the food\, the music\, th
 e culture\, or simply a fun day with family and friends\, there is somethi
 ng for all ages to enjoy.\nGet ready for a delicious celebration of Middle
