  PM for an evening of orchestral power\, drama\, beauty\, and sheer exhila
 ration.\nFirst\, the thunderous spectacle of Tchaikovsky’s 1812 Overture
 —a musical battle cry that surges from tension and anticipation to one o
 f the most triumphant finales ever written.\nThen\, prepare to be swept aw
 ay by Mahler’s Symphony No. 1—a breathtaking journey through mysteriou
 s sounds\, serene beauty\, restless energy\, and ultimately a finale of as
 tonishing\, heart-racing power.\nTwo giants of the repertoire.\nTwo unforg
 ettable musical journeys.\nOne spectacular opening night.\nTchaikovsky —
  1812 Overture\nMahler — Symphony No. 1\nHerbst Theatre\nSaturday\, Octo
 ber 3\n⏰ 7:30 PM\nDon’t just hear the season begin. Experience it.\n
