DESCRIPTION:Golden Gate Park’s 125+ Free Outdoor Bandshell Concert Serie
 s (2026)\nSan Francisco Recreation and Park Department\nFree live music is
  back in the park.\nIlluminate LIVE returns to the Golden Gate Bandshell i
 n Golden Gate Park on Sunday\, March 1\, 2026\, launching its sixth season
  of free outdoor concerts with more than 125 performances scheduled throug
 h mid-November.\nThe long-running series has quietly become one of San Fra
 ncisco’s biggest free music traditions\, drawing more than 250\,000 atte
 ndees each year. Since 2020\, Illuminate LIVE has presented more than 700 
 free concerts and welcomed nearly 1 million music fans to the historic Ban
 dshell (also known as the Spreckels Temple of Music).\n\nAfter the afterno
 on sets\, the 2026 season of Crucial Reggae Sundays launches with resident
  DJs Irie Dole\, Guid8nce and DJ Sep.\n2026 Season – March to Mid- Novem
 ber\nThe 2026 season features more than 125 free\, all-ages performances\,
  typically held:\n\nWednesdays – Midweek Melodies\nFridays – Friday Ha
 ppy Hour\nSundays – Crucial Reggae Sundays\nPlus select Saturdays and sp
 ecial cultural events\n\nOriginally launched during Golden Gate Park’s 1
 50th anniversary\, Illuminate LIVE has grown into a cornerstone of the cit
 y’s free public arts scene\, supported by private funding\, grants and p
 artnership with the San Francisco Recreation and Park Department.\n\n2026 
 Free Bandshell Concert Schedule\nCatch live music in the park every Wednes
 day\, Friday and Sunday (plus select Saturdays) through November. All show
 s are...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://illuminate.org/venues/golden-gate-ban
 dshell/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-bandshell-concert-w
 -3-live-bands-golden-gate-park-2/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/screen
 shot_2024-02-26_3.54.16_pm.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Spreckels Temple of Music (Golden Gate Park Bandshell)\, Music Co
 ncourse Dr\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-outdoor-bandshell-concert-w-3-live-bands-
 golden-gate-park-2/
END:VEVENT
