SUMMARY:Dead Kennedys
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17688604@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Dead Kennedys are an American hardcore punk band formed in San
  Francisco\, California in 1978. The band became part of the American hard
 core punk movement of the early 1980s. They gained a large underground fan
 base in the international punk rock community\, and were one of the first 
 American hardcore bands to make a significant impact in the United Kingdom
 . Their eclectic music encompassed their trademark loud and fast hardcore\
 , but also spaghetti western\, psychedelic\, garage rock and rockabilly. J
 ello Biafra's biting lyrics tackled the sociopolitical concerns of the Rea
 gan era with a distinct sense of morbid humor and satire\, following in th
 e footsteps of such earlier rock satirists as Frank Zappa and non-musical 
 countercultural figures like Abbie Hoffman and Lenny Bruce.\n\nIn the mid-
 1980s\, the band was embroiled in an obscenity trial in the United States 
 over the artwork of their album Frankenchrist (1985)\, which included the 
 explicit titular subject of H. R. Giger's Penis Landscape. The band was ch
 arged with "distribution of harmful matter to minors"\, but the trial ende
 d with a hung jury. Dead Kennedys released five studio albums before disba
 nding in 1986. In 2001\, the band reformed without Biafra\, who had been i
 n a legal dispute with the remaining members over royalties. The band play
 ed three performances in October 2010. At one of the concerts\, they debut
 ed their first new song since 1986\, "You're Such a Fake".\n\nSince the di
 ssolution of Dead Kennedys\, Biafra has continued...\n\nGoldenvoice Presen
 ts\n\nTickets: https://shop.axs.com/?c=axs&e=30567424546669865\nDetails: h
 ttps://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/dead-kennedys-tickets\nSource: DoTheB
 ay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33688261/1df72f92-657a-4814-803d-e12ea4d6db08.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/dead-kennedys-tickets
END:VEVENT
