DESCRIPTION:[MOVED FROM THE CASTRO]\n\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presen
 ts\nSO MUCH HAS CHANGED TOUR\nMARO\n\nMonday\, October 12 | The Castro\n\n
 Our show with MARO at The Castro in San Francisco on April 28\, 2026 has b
 een rescheduled and moved to Bimbo’s 365 Club on October 12th\, 2026.\n\
 nHold on to your tickets! All tickets purchased for the originally schedul
 ed show at The Castro will be honored at the new date at Bimbo's 365 Club.
  We thank you for understanding and look forward to seeing you at the show
 !\n\nA note from MARO:\n\n“Due to circumstances beyond our control\, we 
 are moving the North America tour to September & October of 2026. If you h
 ave purchased a ticket\, your ticket will be good for the new date and ven
 ue. If you are no longer able to attend\, please reach out to your point o
 f purchase to obtain a refund”\n\nMARO is a multi-instrumentalist\, song
 writer\, and producer from Lisbon\, Portugal. After graduating from Berkle
 e College of Music (Boston)\, she debuted her career in 2018\, releasing f
 ive albums and an EP. She later joined Jacob Collier on his DJESSE World T
 our as part of the band. In those years\, MARO opened for artists includin
 g Jessie J\, Gipsy Kings\, Charlotte Cardin and The Paper Kites.\n\nIn 202
 0\, she created ITSAME\, MARO! — a 100-episode collaboration series with
  artists from around the world\, including Eric Clapton\, Pablo Alborán\,
  Lizzy McAlpine\, Ivan Lins\, Vitor Kley\, ANAVITÓRIA\, Sílvia Pérez Cr
 uz\, Maria Gadú\, Mayra Andrade\, Rui Veloso\, and Lennon Stella.\n\nMARO
  won the Festival...\n\n$41.25\, All ages\n[MOVED FROM THE CASTRO] Another
  Planet Entertainment Presents: SO MUCH HAS CHANGED TOUR\nListed time is d
 oors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?Shared
 Id=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fmaro-so-much-has-changed
 -san-francisco-california-04-28-2026%2Fevent%2F1C00635B15F4D47F%3Fcamefrom
 %3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: https://dotheba
 y.com/events/2026/10/12/maro-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
