BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:King Mala
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17583727@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Please note - there is a delivery delay set for 2 weeks prior 
 to show.\n\nWhat would you give for a chance to be the most omnipotent ver
 sion of yourself? To finally be rid of the petty human desires that keep y
 ou from achieving greatness? To finally have it all\, everything you’ve 
 ever wanted? What would you trade? What are you willing to lose? What woul
 d you do for power?\n\nThese questions are at the core of KiNG MALA’s de
 but album\, And You Who Drowned In The Grief Of A Golden Thing. Across its
  wide-ranging 12 tracks – which seesaw between invigorating industrial p
 op and delicately refined R&B balladry – the singer-songwriter spins a t
 ale as equally rooted in a sci-fi nightmare as it is in reality.\n\nThe al
 bum follows the classic storyline of a hero’s journey to redemption\, fo
 cusing on two non-descript\, fictionalized characters: a human and an all-
 mighty entity. The front half is packed with the wonder of “what if.” 
 What would an exchange for power look like? And more importantly\, what wo
 uld it sound like? (Think the experimental\, living aesthetic of Bon Iver
 ’s 22\, A Million or Dijon's Absolutely\, she offers – but with more b
 ite.)\n\nThe back half of the project provides answers – and it’s not 
 pretty. By the story’s end\, the human not only lacks power\, but everyt
 hing that made then human as well. “It's what we become\, because the re
 al dark shit that happens to women\, you are never the same\,” KiNG Mala
  shares.\n\nAnd at a time when the world is embracing such left-of-center 
 storytelli...\n\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents\n\nTickets: https:/
 /ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F
 %2Fwww.ticketweb.com%2Fevent%2Fking-mala-the-independent-tickets%2F1423467
 4%3FREFERRAL_ID%3Dtmfeedbuyat234705%26wt.mc_id%3Daff_BUYAT_234705%26camefr
 om%3DCFC_BUYAT_234705\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/12/kin
 g-mala-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7755362;-122.4376556
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33208133/a6e75559-f623-49f0-aae8-b5fef37c5970.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Independent\, 628 Divisadero Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94
 117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/12/king-mala-tickets
END:VEVENT
