SUMMARY:Sex Pistols (Steve Jones\, Paul Cook\, Glen Matlock)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T223000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17035971@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\n\n50 Years of Punk | Anarchy In The U.K.
 \nSex Pistols (Steve Jones\, Paul Cook\, Glen Matlock)\nFeaturing Frank Ca
 rter\n\nWednesday\, October 14 | The Warfield\n\nIf tickets in the accessi
 ble section are unavailable\, please reach out to the venue for accommodat
 ions. Please note\, orders in violation of the published ticket limit are 
 subject to cancellation without notice.\n\nOn the afternoon of his first a
 ppearance onstage with the Sex Pistols\, last summer at Bush Hall\, Frank 
 Carter’s peaceful afternoon stroll on the streets of Shepherd’s Bush w
 as interrupted by a stranger sat outside a pub. “Big shoes\,” the man 
 shouted\; nothing more\, nothing less.\n\n“That’s all he said\,” Car
 ter reports. “And I just replied ‘thanks for noticing’\, and off I w
 alked. But I thought\, ‘Fucking hell\, we’ve not even played one note 
 yet’. At that point I felt like I was melting. I realised I had to get m
 y shit together here.”\n\nAs if the matter was ever in doubt\, hours lat
 er\, he did just that. The stranger’s assertion that anyone stepping up 
 to the microphone with the band who terrorised a nation faces one of the t
 allest orders in rock and roll – make no mistake\, filling big shoes req
 uires big cojones – overlooked the fact that he was speaking to one of t
 he few singers\, and perhaps even the <> singer\, capable of handling the 
 job. Over the course of three boisterously received concerts staged to rai
 se funds for the imperilled Bush Hall\, this most famous and infamous of a
 cts was born anew with ene...\n\nAll Ages\nGoldenvoice Presents: 50 Years 
 of Punk | Anarchy In The U.K.\n\nTickets: https://www.thewarfieldtheatre.c
 om/events/detail/908696\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/14/s
 ex-pistols-steve-jones-paul-cook-glen-matlock-feat-frank-carter-tickets\nS
 ource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/30602934/7b617254-e985-45b5-8b0f-cd2fd975926e.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Warfield\, 982 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/14/sex-pistols-steve-jones-paul-co
 ok-glen-matlock-feat-frank-carter-tickets
END:VEVENT
