DESCRIPTION:“Union Square Dances” Free Outdoor Friday Night Dance Part
 y (SF)\nChad McCall\nCome out to Union Square Park every Friday from 5 pm 
 to 8 pm through October 16 for our free Union Square Dances. Enjoy rotatin
 g styles of live music and dancing\, including Salsa\, Country Western\, S
 wing\, Bollywood\, and Tango. Each event starts with a lesson followed by 
 open dancing.\nJoin us Friday\, August 21\, for Swing Dance presented by S
 ilver Bell Jazz Band featuring Heidi Evelyn.\nPlus\, enjoy free daily prog
 ramming at Union Square Park (Geary St & Powell St)\, with activities for 
 all ages throughout the week. All programs are free and open to the public
 . For more information\, check out our website: https://visitunionsquaresf
 .com/park-programs.\n\nUpcoming “Union Square Dances” Free Outdoor Fri
 day Night Dance Party (SF) Events\nFri 10/9 “Union Square Dances” Free
  Outdoor Friday Night Dance Party (SF)Fri 10/16 “Union Square Dances” 
 Free Outdoor Friday Night Dance Party (SF)Disclaimer: Please double check 
 event information with the event organizer as events can be canceled\, det
 ails can change after they are added to our calendar\, and errors do occur
 .\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://visitunionsquaresf.com/park-programs\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/union-square-dances-free-outdoor-friday-night-d
 ance-party-sf-9/\nSource: Funcheap SF
