UID:funcheap-1637866@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSideTrack Bar + GrillIt’s ti
 me to take out your lederhosen and dirndl dress! SideTrack’s Oktoberfest
  celebration is back\, bringing a biergarten experience to downtown Pleasa
 nton on Friday\, October 16 and Saturday\, October 17!\nThe two-day event 
 features a special menu of German food and drink\, live entertainment by P
 olkageist West\, fun games and plenty of festive decor!\n\nThe event is fr
 ee to attend with food and drink tickets available for purchase at the doo
 r. For guests looking to guarantee a spot inside the tents each evening\, 
 packages are available for pre-purchase which include seats\, food and dri
 nk and a limited edition beer stein.\nEnjoy menu of Oktoberfest-inspired f
 ood and drink including Za German Plate with sausages\, German potato sala
 d\, red cabbage and sauerkraut and Za Vorks – the Za German Plate with a
  beer in commemorative SideTrack stein (limited quantities). A menu of a l
 a carte items includes pretzels and special items for kids like hot dogs\,
  mac and cheese and tater tots.\nSideTrack also welcomes back Pleasanton
 ’s Primrose Bakery\, selling their German cookies and cakes throughout t
 he weekend while local breweries will be featured alongside traditional Ge
 rman beer like Hofbräu München and Paulaner Oktoberfest Märzen. Wine an
 d additional beverages are available as well.\nTickets + Pricing: Admissio
 n is free with food and drink tickets available at the door.\nGuarantee yo
 ur seat and reserve food and beverage packages in advance for F...\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://www.sidetrackeats.com/oktoberfest/\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/oktoberfest-sidetrack-pleasanton/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ST-Okt
 oberfest-Poster-No-QR-Codes-2026.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:SideTrack Bar + Grill\, 30 West Angela Street\, Pleasanton
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/oktoberfest-sidetrack-pleasanton/
END:VEVENT
