SUMMARY:Iron & Wine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-16929979@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nIron & Wine\n\nFriday\,
  October 16 | The Castro\n\n“I’ve always wanted to use that title\,”
  Sam Beam says of Hen’s Teeth\, his eighth full-length album and his six
 th for Sub Pop Records. “I just love it. To me it suggests the impossibl
 e. Hen’s teeth do not exist. And that’s what this record felt like: a 
 gift that shouldn’t be there but it is. An impossible thing but it’s r
 eal.”\n\nHen’s Teeth and his previous album\, Light Verse\, are siblin
 gs of a sort. They were recorded during the same sessions after a years-lo
 ng dry spell\, with the same band\, at Waystation studio in Laurel Canyon.
  “When I’ve been on a writing kick\, and the band can meet me where I
 ’m at\, they push me into something I hadn’t imagined. I’m at a poin
 t in my life where spontaneity is a lot more important to me. I don’t ha
 ve as much to prove as I used to. I’m a lot freer and I love making musi
 c more than ever. There are no right or wrong answers. You just pray for y
 our luck and try your best.”\n\nIn this case prayers were answered and l
 uck struck hard. The musicians cohered so quickly and inspired each other 
 so much that they were often getting songs recorded in just a few takes\, 
 sometimes at the rate of two or three per day. The two albums might theref
 ore be thought of as fraternal twins: they share DNA and complement each o
 ther but have distinct identities and are defined as much by their differe
 nces as their similarities.\n\nLight Verse (2024) took its name from a for
 m of poetry that m...\n\nall ages\nSold out\nAnother Planet Entertainment 
 presents\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c
 /253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%
 2Firon-wine-san-francisco-california-10-16-2026%2Fevent%2F1C00643EF001AC85
 %3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: http
 s://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/iron-wine-ken-pomeroy-tickets\nSource: 
 DoTheBay
