  merges movement\, prevention\, sustainability and neighborhood pride into
  one exciting festival at the SECC featuring health screenings and educati
 on\, entertainment and food trucks.\nThis year’s theme\, Bayview in Moti
 on\, celebrates movement\, wellness\, and community for a day of health\, 
 healing\, and collective joy in San Francisco’s District 10. This annual
  event will highlight the importance of holistic well-being through fun ac
 tivities\, community resources\, and opportunities for residents of all ag
