DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerGemini​Looking for a night o
 ut in San Francisco that beats dinner and a movie?\n​Taste your way thro
 ugh 40+ acclaimed Bay Area restaurants and beverage partners\, enjoy live 
 music\, and dress up for a good cause.\n​Join us October 17\, 2026 at th
 e San Francisco Design Center Galleria for Plate by Plate\, the nation’s
  oldest and largest tasting benefit gala supporting AAPI philanthropy\, or
 ganized entirely by volunteers.\n\n​You’ll also hear stories of impact
  that support this year’s campaign theme\, Communities in Action: foster
 ing growth and resilience in AAPI neighborhoods and small businesses.\n​
 One ticket. Unlimited menu. (it’s like omakase\, but better )\nBites and
  sips from partners including Sushi Roku Palo Alto\, Tsar Nicoulai Caviar\
 , Asian Box\, Papa Noodle\, Cassava\, Kaiyo\, Kojo-Kojo Fusion\, and Littl
 e Green Cyclo\, plus pours from Kanosuke Distillery\, Patrón Tequila\, As
 ahi\, Johnnie Walker\, Ektimo Vineyards\, and more. Vegetarian and vegan i
 tems will be marked on menus.\n​Also on the night: clubbing\, but make i
 t grown-up 🪩\n\n​Live music and entertainment. Bring your snazziest d
 ance moves. Cocktail attire\, zero sticky floors.\n\n​Silent auction. Bi
 d on getaways and goodies from Axiom Hotel\, Fitness SF\, Kiln\, Iberia Re
 staurant\, Mr Espresso\, Bradford Portraits\, Chubby Hands Ceramic\, and m
 ore. Outbid your friends for a good cause.\n\n​Photo booth by Kande. Str
 ike a pose\, grab the strips\, and take home proof of a very good night.\n
 \n​Maxx your giving-back era ✨\nPro...\n\n$209.00\n\nTickets: https://
 www.platebyplate.org/san-francisco\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/plate
 -plate-san-francisco-2026-tasting-benefit-aapi-communities/\nSource: Funch
 eap SF
