DESCRIPTION:Undiscovered SF\n\n​✦ UNDISCOVERED SF\nSan Francisco’s F
 irst Night Market Is Back\n​Ten years ago\, Undiscovered started the tre
 nd of night markets. Now\, we return during golden hour.\nRSVP – FREE\n
 ​This year marks a special milestone — join us as we celebrate 10 seas
 ons of community\, creativity\, and cultural pride! For our second hub\, w
 e are so excited to bring back UNDISCOVERED SF Season 10: the Golden Hour 
 Night Market in partnership with Victory Hall.\n\n​Nestled in the fabled
  Ritch Street Alley\, Victory Hall has been a cornerstone of SoMa since 19
 08 — home to the legendary 330 Ritch Nightclub and a long legacy of musi
 c\, community\, and culture in partnership with Deanna Sison\, a culinary 
 trailblazer\, a custodian of Filipino tradition\, and an influential force
  in San Francisco’s hospitality scene.\n​On October 24\, we’re honor
 ed to be part of that legacy — filling Ritch Street with Filipino Americ
 an food\, art\, music\, and culture in the heart of the Filipino Cultural 
 Corridor.\n#UNDSCVRDseason10 #MadewithMahal\n​✦ Come hungry. Come read
 y to move. Come discover.\n​\n​Eat your way through the market\, shop 
 retail vendors\, catch DJ sets\, and step inside Victory Hall for a specia
 l exhibition honoring the history of 330 Ritch\, the legendary nightclub t
 hat once made this block pulse after dark.\n​✦ Anchored by Mestiza and
  Victory Hall\, UNDSCVRD Golden Hour Night Market is an intimate but elect
 ric return: a celebration of ten years of Undiscovered\, the flavors of ou
 r community\, and the people who...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/r
 aipa01b\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-golden-hour-filipino-night-m
 arket-2026-soma/\nSource: Funcheap SF
